# The candidate pool for this port.
#
# ⚠ Both entries are anchors, so gen-mirrorlist finds no candidate to rank.
# ArchPOWER has no second host: searched 2026-08-28, base/any carries no
# pacman-mirrorlist package among its 2200 packages and both archlinuxpower.org
# and kth5/archpower name only repo.archlinuxpower.org.
#
# ⛔ Leave the file. An architecture with no pool file takes a different branch
# in gen-mirrorlist, and a missing file would read as an oversight rather than
# as a measured absence.
https://repo.archlinuxpower.org/$repo/$arch
https://api.rv.pkgforge.dev/https://repo.archlinuxpower.org/$repo/$arch
